          "source": "wotc",
          "published_at": "2008-08-01",
          "comment": "Chroma abilities check only mana costs, which are found in a card\u2019s upper right corner. They don\u2019t count mana symbols that appear in a card\u2019s text box."
        },
        {
          "object": "ruling",
          "oracle_id": "4d6ad734-b8b5-4d91-9b7b-1fa0c55bfa4f",
          "source": "wotc",
          "published_at": "2008-08-01",
          "comment": "Chroma abilities count hybrid mana symbols of the appropriate color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U/R}{U/R} has two red mana symbols in its mana cost."
        },
        {
          "object": "ruling",
          "oracle_id": "4d6ad734-b8b5-4d91-9b7b-1fa0c55bfa4f",
          "source": "wotc",
          "published_at": "2008-08-01",
          "comment": "Light from Within affects each creature individually. For example, if you control a creature with mana cost {1}{W}{W} and a creature with mana cost {W/B}{W/B}{W/B}{W/B}{W/B}, the first creature gets +2/+2 and the second creature gets +5/+5."
        }
      ]
